{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55344","headline":"题东林二首 一 · 匡白","name":"题东林二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东林佳景一何长，兰蕙生多地亦香，堪叹世人来不得，便随云树老何妨。\n倚天苍翠晴当户，落[石]潺湲夜遶廊。\n到此秪除重结社，自余闲事莫思量。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"匡白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55344.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55344","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}